IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PROG-STREAMING-SINK.

DATA DIVISION.
01 SEQ-LEN             PIC 9(9) USAGE R0.
01 SINK-TOKENS         PIC 9(9) USAGE R1.
01 WINDOW-SIZE         PIC 9(9) USAGE R2.
01 EVICTION-SPEEDUP    PIC 9(9) USAGE R3.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-STREAMING-SINK.
    IF WINDOW-SIZE == 0
        GO TO ERROR-EXIT.
    END-IF.

    IF SEQ-LEN > WINDOW-SIZE
        MOVE SEQ-LEN TO EVICTION-SPEEDUP.
        DIVIDE WINDOW-SIZE INTO EVICTION-SPEEDUP.
    ELSE
        MOVE 1 TO EVICTION-SPEEDUP.
    END-IF.

    SET depth 3.
    WEIGHT 32 EVICTION-SPEEDUP.
    WEIGHT 30 SINK-TOKENS.
    EVAL.
    PRUNE 15.
    GO TO END-STRATEGY.

ERROR-EXIT.
    SET depth 0.
    EVAL.

END-STRATEGY.
